    {
      "id": "edgelong.attack.allies.seventeen",
      "label": "Two terrible forces...",
      "startdescription": "The War-Maker's actions have drawn the attention of that nightmare. Frost and flame are converging.",
      "slots": [
          {
            "id": "needsfoe",
            "label": "The Seventeenth Night",
            "required": {
                "foe.seventeen": 1
            },
            "greedy": true
          }
      ],
      "linked": [
          {
            "id": "edgelong.attack.allies.seventeen.end.1"
          },
          {
            "id": "edgelong.expel"
          }
      ],
      "warmup": 10
    },
    {
      "id": "edgelong.attack.allies.seventeen.end.1",
      "label": "Two terrible forces collide!",
      "startdescription": "The nightmare attacks the War-Maker! Frost and flame clash violently, entwining without cease; the earth trembles from the struggle of these two powers. The armies of both sides flee in terror from their path, and those unable to escape are ground to dust in an instant.",
      "requirements": {
        "foe.seventeen": 1
      },
      "warmup": 30,
      "linked": [
        {
          "id": "edgelong.attack.allies.seventeen.end.2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "edgelong.attack.allies.seventeen.end.2",
      "label": "Flame against frost",
      "startdescription": "The War-Maker roars and wields his flame, while the nightmare answers with death-bearing winds. The two terrible forces clash again and again, their sound drowning out even the roar of artillery. I believe the War-Maker is at a disadvantage; his flames are always quenched swiftly, but the resilience of a Long is beyond imagination. This battle may yet drag on, or the next clash may decide the victor.",
      "warmup": 30,
      "linked": [
        {
          "id": "edgelong.attack.allies.seventeen.end.3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "edgelong.attack.allies.seventeen.end.3",
      "label": "The decisive blow?",
      "startdescription": "The War-Maker drives the nightmare back once more, but this time he does not press his advantage; I see fierce flames erupt upon his body. With a stomp that cracks the earth, a fist wreathed in flame tears through the freezing wind around the nightmare like a falling star, and then a blinding flash precedes the thunderclap as vast steam swallows them both.",
      "warmup": 30,
      "linked": [
        {
          "id": "edgelong.attack.allies.seventeen.end"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "edgelong.attack.allies.seventeen.end",
      "label": "Winter's victory",
      "startdescription": "The steam is blown away and cooled by the wind, revealing the nightmare's form; it must have been weakened, yet it can still spread cold and death. The War-Maker is nowhere to be seen, but I believe he has only retreated for now. In any case, this battle is over, and we must continue to face the nightmare's harrying.",
      "effects": {
        "foe.wilhelm": -1
      },
      "aspects": {
        "zeroseventeen": 1
      },
      "achievements": [
          "achievements.wilhelmseventeen"
      ],
      "warmup": 30
    },

